@startuml cu78
!theme plain
title CU78 — Seguridad, Privacidad y Cumplimiento

actor "User (Usuario)" as Actor
participant "Notaire system" as System

Actor -> Actor : The user enters their credentials (username and password).
System -> System : User
Actor -> Actor : Validates the credentials against the secure hash in the encrypted database.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : If the credentials are valid, an authenticated session is created with a signed token.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Sends the secure token over an encrypted HTTPS/TLS channel.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The user requests to run an operation on a procedure or client.
System -> System : User
Actor -> Actor : Validates the user's role permissions and authorizes the execution.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : The system processes the operation.
System -> System : System
Actor -> Actor : Records the action in the immutable audit log with user, date, time, and IP.
System -> System : System

@enduml
